# Baseline security headers for every response.
# Deliberately no X-Robots-Tag (indexing must stay open, resume included)
# and no CSP yet — deferred to the Concierge embed pass per the anti-scrape
# spec (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-27-antiscrape-hardening-design.md).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
